{"id":"n14448-2-8","stage":3,"title":"뛰어나오다 · 从…跑出来","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14448-2-8-1","ko":"왜 비명을 지르며 창고를 뛰어나오니?","zh":"你怎么会尖叫着从仓库里跑出来？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"비명을","meaning":"悲鸣，哀鸣，惊叫，惨叫","explanation":"비명：悲鸣，哀鸣，惊叫，惨叫；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"비명","audio":"/audio/4f7a3233b258f2c7f3b2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15756","senseId":"1","lemma":"비명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비명을","audio":"/audio/41d1bd2f0e2749faf649.mp3"}},{"text":"지르며","meaning":"喊叫","explanation":"지르다：喊叫；며：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"지르다","audio":"/audio/987e83fdad67159dfb76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62312","senseId":"1","lemma":"지르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지르며","audio":"/audio/cdc3a96d3efa4babdc50.mp3"}},{"text":"창고를","meaning":"仓库，库房","explanation":"창고：仓库，库房；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"창고","audio":"/audio/5f4ebee4ce9930e7c79f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71808","senseId":"1","lemma":"창고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"창고를","audio":"/audio/286c97df7f44b09c6c50.mp3"}},{"text":"뛰어나오니?","meaning":"从…跑出来","explanation":"뛰어나오다：从…跑出来；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"뛰어나오다","audio":"/audio/04ae35dfe96c356c16ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14448","senseId":"2","lemma":"뛰어나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뛰어나오니","audio":"/audio/cc1413aeae6a66f18933.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"